{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060836/block/singleImage/3251540/df/01M61EDKK2QJ12F58QFZ47MPR8.jpg?updatedAt=1793197718\"/><figcaption>警方拘捕一名70歲男子。</figcaption></figure><p>將軍澳警區特別職務隊人員根據線報及經深入調查後，今日(28日)展開打擊毒品行動，一名70歲男子涉嫌「販運危險藥物」被捕。</p><p>行動中，警方突擊搜查將軍澳一個公屋單位，並在單位內檢獲約940克懷疑氯胺酮，以及約136克懷疑霹靂可卡因，市值約53萬元。經初步調查，警方以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」，拘捕一名70歲本地男子。被捕人現正被扣留調查，案件仍在調查中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:41:10.394479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:28:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.128761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:23.163874+00:00","content_hash":"3b47b117c28626f76ddb939091285a1cee05c0069e8f847725b1024ce39cd21c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:41:10.394479+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}